guide forever/reputation/arathi-basin
title Arathi Basin Reputation
category Reputation
levels 20-60
zone Arathi Highlands
# The League of Arathor (509, Alliance) and The Defilers (510, Horde).
# Exalted with each battleground reputation is one of Forever's Legacy PvP
# Challenges (one account-wide Legacy Point each; official Legacy System news).
#
# From the Era-baseline reference data: the faction NPCs at Refuge Pointe
# (Field Marshal Oslight, Sergeant Maclear, Samuel Hawke) and Hammerfall
# (Deathmaster Dwire, Deathstalker Mortis, Rutherford Twing), their turn-ins
# (The Battle for Arathi Basin! 8105/8166-8168 and 8120/8169-8171, Control /
# Take Four and Five Bases 8114/8115 and 8121/8122, Arathi Resource Crate
# turn-ins 8080/8154-8159/8297/8298 and 8123/8124/8160-8165/8299/8300), the
# care packages (8260-8262, 8263-8265) and the weekend Call to Arms quests.
# Forever's Field of Honor season reworks PvP and may change these, so they
# stay notes until a live recording confirms them; the steps track the
# standing itself (rep 509/510). Enter the battleground from any battlemaster.

step League of Arathor to Friendly
  only Alliance
  tip The League of Arathor fights for Arathi Basin from Refuge Pointe. Their reputation comes from the battleground: the resources your team gathers pay it to everyone, so holding more bases for longer pays more. Queue at any battlemaster. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains.
  talk 14983 optional -- Field Marshal Oslight, Refuge Pointe
  note Field Marshal Oslight's The Battle for Arathi Basin! (assault every base) and Control Four Bases / Control Five Bases are one-time quests in the data; Sergeant Maclear beside him takes Arathi Resource Crates.
  rep 509 Friendly

step League of Arathor to Honored
  only Alliance
  tip Keep playing Arathi Basin. On Call to Arms: Arathi Basin weekends the Alliance Brigadier General in the capitals takes three Arathi Basin Marks of Honor for extra reputation.
  talk 15127 optional -- Samuel Hawke hands out one Arathor care package by level
  rep 509 Honored

step League of Arathor to Revered
  only Alliance
  tip Keep playing Arathi Basin; wins with many bases held pay the most.
  rep 509 Revered

step League of Arathor to Exalted
  only Alliance
  tip Exalted with the League of Arathor earns a Legacy Point.
  rep 509 Exalted

step The Defilers to Friendly
  only Horde
  tip The Defilers fight for Arathi Basin from Hammerfall. Their reputation comes from the battleground: the resources your team gathers pay it to everyone, so holding more bases for longer pays more. Queue at any battlemaster. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains.
  talk 15021 optional -- Deathmaster Dwire, Hammerfall
  note Deathmaster Dwire's The Battle for Arathi Basin! (assault every base) and Take Four Bases / Take Five Bases are one-time quests in the data; Deathstalker Mortis beside him takes Arathi Resource Crates.
  rep 510 Friendly

step The Defilers to Honored
  only Horde
  tip Keep playing Arathi Basin. On Call to Arms: Arathi Basin weekends the Horde Warbringer in the capitals takes three Arathi Basin Marks of Honor for extra reputation.
  talk 15126 optional -- Rutherford Twing hands out one Defiler's care package by level
  rep 510 Honored

step The Defilers to Revered
  only Horde
  tip Keep playing Arathi Basin; wins with many bases held pay the most.
  rep 510 Revered

step The Defilers to Exalted
  only Horde
  tip Exalted with The Defilers earns a Legacy Point.
  rep 510 Exalted
